## Frequency guide

Not every line here is a rule. Mark each one so the system knows how hard to hold it.

- **Hard rule.** Never violate. Usually lives in the Never section.
- **Strong tendency.** Do this 70 to 80% of the time. Breaking it occasionally reads as
  human.
- **Light preference.** Context decides.

[Mark the lines above.]

## The litmus test

Read a two-paragraph draft aloud. Does it sound like [NAME] in the room? If it sounds
like something written to impress, it is wrong.

